stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Preparing: Finalized dataset and valid profile
    Preparing --> Preparing: Claim generation, verify cases, acknowledge files
    Preparing --> Preparing: Retry same inputs after lease release or expiry
    Preparing --> Ready: Verified complete manifest, fenced SQL commit
    Preparing --> Cancelled: run cancel
    Ready --> Ready: Identical command returns existing reference
    Ready --> Cancelled: run cancel
    Ready --> [*]: Preparation complete, run remains creating
    Cancelled --> [*]: Further publication rejected
    note right of Ready
        Plan readiness creates no dispatch cursor
        and grants no worker authority.
    end note
